se advise where you learned of the position: (Open Ended Question) Applicant Documents Required Documents Curriculum Vitae Bachelor's Degree - Copy of transcripts Master's Degree -  Copy of transcripts Optional Documents Certificate of Release or Discharge from Active Duty (DD-214) Resume Cover Letter Other Degree - Copy of transcripts Letter of Reference 1 Letter of Reference 2 Letter of Reference 3 Copy of Education Transcripts Other Document Ph.D.  - Copy of transcripts Contact Division of Human Resources Phone: (336) 334-7862 Fax: (336) 285-2799 Email: hr@ncat.edu 1806 E. Market Street, Suite 401, Greensboro, NC 27401 To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
