, within a 2-hour commuting distance of their assigned duty station. Quick Link https://jobs.ncat.edu/postings/40794 Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Please indicate how you learned of the vacant position for which you are applying. NCA&T Website UNC System Job Board Indeed.com NCA&T Employee Chronicle of Higher Education Inside Higher Ed Higher Education Recruitment Consortium Other_____________ If you indicated you learned of this employment opportunity from an “Other” source please advise where you learned of the position: (Open Ended Question) Applicant Documents Required Documents Curriculum Vitae Letter of Interest Bachelor's Degree - Copy of transcripts Master's Degree -  Copy of transcripts Ph.D.  - Copy of transcripts Optional Documents Letter of Reference 1 Letter of Reference 2 Letter of Reference 3 Certificate of Release or Discharge from Active Duty (DD-214) Other Document Research Statement Other Degree - Copy of transcripts Contact Division of Human Resources Phone: (336) 334-7862 Fax: (336) 285-2799 Email: hr@ncat.edu 1806 E. Market Street, Suite 401, Greensboro, NC 27401 To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
